Z||000003||Tigger||03-22-2001||08:28 AM||||I used to get those too Darklord.  Most people who sent them to me were people I knew on ICQ or people I knew that I played racing games with online.<P>I got a few that were saying the US Mail was going to start charging you for using internet email unless you sent the message out to everyone on your list.  Yea, right, hit the delete button - "poof"<P>I've also got one or two messages saying something like a little girl in Topeka KS needs a major surgery so send this letter out to as many people as you can because for every name it goes to, "some company" will donate $.01.  <P>So, what do you do?<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 03-22-2001).]||||reg||1
